    "code": "import numpy as np, cv2\n\n# the ground homography of section 11.1, measured once in the reference frame\nground = np.float32([[0, 0], [20, 0], [20, 30], [0, 30]])\nimage = np.float32([[300, 700], [980, 700], [760, 250], [520, 250]])\nH_ref = cv2.getPerspectiveTransform(image, ground)\n\ndef to_ground(H, pts):\n    p = cv2.perspectiveTransform(np.float32(pts).reshape(-1, 1, 2), H)\n    return p.reshape(-1, 2)\n",
